message: "If you use this software or data, please cite both the paper and this deposit."
title: "Open RTU: an open reference instrument for grid-side frequency compliance monitoring"
type: software
version: "1.2.0"
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Davies-Energy-Electronics/open-rtu"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21575262"
abstract: >-
  Firmware, bill of materials, SCADA HMI, analysis toolchain, bench captures,
  acquisition-chain characterisation records and the LTspice conditioning netlist
  for a dual-ESP32 Remote Terminal Unit proxy validated by replaying the NESO
  one-second frequency record of the 9 August 2019 GB event. Release v1.2.0 is the
  release cited by the submitted manuscript.
keywords:
  - remote terminal unit
  - replay validation
  - grid frequency
  - offshore wind
  - DNP3
  - TOST equivalence testing
  - ESP32
